---
// Propuesta de valor - 4 bloques estilo Mentaris
---

<div class="value-grid">
  <div class="value-item">
    <div class="value-icon-wrap">
      <span class="value-emoji"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.12em"><path d="M12 6.528V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h0" /> <path d="M18.237 21A15 15 0 0 0 22 11a6 6 0 0 0-10-4.472A6 6 0 0 0 2 11a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 3.763 10 3 3 0 0 0 3.648.648 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 5.178 0A3 3 0 0 0 18.237 21" /></svg></span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="value-title">Plan 100% personalizado</h3>
    <p class="value-text">
      Cada cuerpo es único, por eso tu plan está adaptado a tus objetivos, gustos y estilo de vida.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="value-item">
    <div class="value-icon-wrap">
      <span class="value-emoji"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.12em"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" /> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6" /> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2" /></svg></span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="value-title">Acompañamiento continuo</h3>
    <p class="value-text">
      Resolución de dudas y ajustes constantes para que siempre estés acompañado en el proceso.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="value-item">
    <div class="value-icon-wrap">
      <span class="value-emoji"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.12em"><path d="M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2" /> <path d="M6.453 15h11.094" /> <path d="M8.5 2h7" /></svg></span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="value-title">Enfoque basado en ciencia</h3>
    <p class="value-text">
      Sin dietas milagro. Todo está respaldado por evidencia científica y experiencia clínica.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="value-item">
    <div class="value-icon-wrap">
      <span class="value-emoji"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.12em"><path d="M19.496 12a2.5 2.5 0 00.399-2.214A2 2 0 0020.32 6.5 2 2 0 0019 3a2 2 0 00-1.5.68 2 2 0 00-3.287.424 2.5 2.5 0 00-3.189 2.06A3 3 0 0012 12l4-4" /> <path d="M4 12a1 1 0 00-.99 1.133A9 9 0 0012 21a9 9 0 008.99-7.867A1 1 0 0020 12z" /> <path d="M7 21h10" /> <path d="M9.85 6.907A3.5 3.5 0 005.05 12" /></svg></span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="value-title">Sin restricciones absurdas</h3>
    <p class="value-text">
      No se trata de prohibir, sino de crear un equilibrio sostenible que puedas mantener siempre.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .value-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .value-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .value-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .value-item {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-md);
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .value-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .value-icon-wrap {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold-light);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-md);
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .value-item:hover .value-icon-wrap {
    background: var(--gold);
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }

  .value-emoji {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .value-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .value-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
